## 20. Security threat model

| Угроза | Контроль |
|---|---|
| forged tenant id in application code | opaque authority-bound scope |
| magic/custom runtime task bypasses tenancy | task gets only minted scope/runtime, capability restrictions, startup graph validation and contract tests |
| mutable singleton leaks tenant A into tenant B | no global DataSource/DSLContext/Environment/CacheManager mutation; scoped runtime and concurrent two-tenant tests |
| header spoofing | application TrustedTenantHeaderVerifier, mismatch refusal |
| stateful session used under another tenant host | principal/host agreement plus optional rain-access TenantSessionBinding and session-switch tests |
| confused deputy principal vs host | authoritative candidate agreement |
| connection reuse after tenant switch | unit/transaction pin before connection |
| stale job after restore | epoch in signed job context и lookup |
| token transplanted to another job | MAC covers namespace, definition, invocation, payload digest |
| wrong JDBC mapping | tenant-local source fence |
| pool exhaustion by tenant flood | reserved slot, total connection budget, idle-only eviction |
| RLS bypass | non-owner non-BYPASSRLS role, FORCE RLS, verifier tests |
| cross-tenant FK/join | tenant columns in keys/FKs плюс RLS |
| control upsert bypasses lifecycle | closed CAS commands |
| admin credentials leak into runtime | separate provisioner port/secret |
| event type takeover | explicit unique catalogue |
| mutable event history | DB trigger/grants/schema verifier |
| idempotency key reuse for another request | request fingerprint collision |
| late event skipped by projector | xid settlement cursor |
| partial projection commit | SameUnit authority and rollback |
| rebuild sends emails twice | effects suppressed outside active generation |
| old or retired generation stages an effect | persisted effect barrier plus locking active-generation gate in same Unit |
| dead letter breaks sequence | ParkSequence |
| partition scale skips or double-applies a sequence | checked exact cover and durable parent-to-children split |
| secrets/tenant in telemetry | redaction and low-cardinality rules |
| cache key or object path crosses tenant boundary | digest+epoch namespace, explicit GlobalCache/GlobalObjectStore, generation invalidation and path traversal refusal |
| tenant setting changes security/routing | startup-declared typed setting spec; protected keys and control-plane CAS/audit |
| malicious oversized payload/cursor | byte ceilings before allocation/SQL |

Провести отдельный security review до GA database mode и до GA cross-tenant grants.

## 21. Тестовая стратегия

### 21.1 Общие правила

- JUnit Jupiter, AssertJ, MockK и Testcontainers, как в Rain.
- Unit classes заканчиваются Test, integration — IT с Tag integration.
- Никаких sleep; MutableClock, latches, barriers и database locks.
- Coverage bounds отдельны по модулю; target не ниже текущего уровня Rain, critical branches 100%.
- Все растущие queries имеют bounded-plan assertion.
- Test failure проверяет не только exception type, но и отсутствие writes/side effects.
- Concurrency tests имеют control case, чтобы тест не мог пройти из-за never-ran branch.

### 21.2 Tenancy unit tests

